1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:08,852
The list shows every entry point with the channel it answers and its numbers.

2
00:00:08,852 --> 00:00:11,929
Edit changes one, and Delete removes it.

3
00:00:11,929 --> 00:00:17,080
A disabled entry point answers nothing, so untick Enabled to pause one.

4
00:00:17,584 --> 00:00:23,331
To start from an existing entry point, open its Actions menu and choose Clone.

5
00:00:23,331 --> 00:00:28,052
The form opens with every setting copied, and the name Copy of.

6
00:00:28,052 --> 00:00:33,524
Numbers starts empty, because each number has one entry point per channel.

